    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kere Yehoahaz ma Isiraili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I oro ma piero ario g'adek ma dhum pa Yowas paka kere ma Yuda, Yehoahaz obedo kere ma Isiraili, aka odhumo i Samaria ma oro apar g'abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oluwo tim pa Yerobowam, aka otimo reco kwoŋ Rwoth to miyo Isiraili timo reco, go k'oŋuto weyo tim pere marac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno nge pa Rwoth oliel kwoŋ Isiraili, aka oweyo kere Hazael ma Siria kodi wode Benhadad kikengila Isiraili kisi hongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo kere Yehoahaz okwayo Rwoth, aka munyo Rwoth oneno nger ma kere ma Siria oyido diyo Joisiraili, odwoko kwayo pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno Rwoth omiyo Joisiraili jatel m'obotho jo wok i cingi Josiria, aka Joisiraili jobedo gi siem paka con. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Joisiraili jok'oŋuto reco ma kere Yerobowam omiyo jo timo, to jomedere timo, aka cal pa were madhako Asera odoŋ i Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahaz oyido odoŋ nyaka gi cwo piero abic ma jogwey kayina, cawila apar, kodi cwo 10,000 ma jowotho, kwoŋbedo kere ma Siria oyido oreyo ma jodoŋ to nyono jo paka fukefuke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gigipiny man je ma kere Yehoahaz otimo kodi tim pere ma miseni ondiki i kitawo ma kigana ma mako kwoŋ kerin ma Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go otho aka oyiki go i Samaria to wode Yehowas lunjo go paka kere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kere Yehowas ma Isiraili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I oro ma piero adek g'abirio ma dhum pa kere Yowas ma Yuda, Yehowas obedo kere ma Isiraili, aka odhumo i Samaria ma oro apar g'aucel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go bende otimo reco kwoŋ Rwoth aka oluwo kite pa kere Yerobowam, m'omiyo Isiraili timo reco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gigipiny man je ma Yehowas otimo kodi tim ma miseni i lweny kwoŋ kere Amaziya ma Yuda ondiki i kitawo ma kigana ma mako kwoŋ kerin ma Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowas otho aka oyiki go i kaliel pa kerin i Samaria, to wode Yerobowam mar'ario lunjo go paka kere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tho pa Elisa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
